# DRIFTLINE: stage 4's boss, Old Crab (on a visit from ROOFCAT's harbour).
# Only the yellow mark on its shell takes damage; the rest of the shell
# stops shots. Its six legs change colour before each slams the road. It
# blows bubbles in fans of three, four and five. The swells keep coming.
# 40,000 points.
game driftline
wait 12
press A
cheat stage 4
cheat boss
waituntil boss_on == 1 10
expect boss_kind == 3
expect boss_hp == 800
waituntil boss_y >= 36 200
# the legs: a warning first, the foot still up, then the slam
waituntil part_t2 >= 0 100
expect part_t2 < 50
cheat god
wait 40
expect alive0 == 1
# the bubbles, in fans
waituntil eshots_3 == 3 120
cheat clear
cheat bossstill
cheat meter 700
# off the mark: the shell takes it
cheat posboss -20
hold UP 30
hold B 60
expect boss_hp == 800
# on the mark
cheat posboss 0
hold B 60
expect boss_hp < 800
cheat bosshp 1
hold B
waituntil boss_dead == 1 60
release
expect score == 40000
# a leg's slam takes a car under it
cheat bossstill
cheat stage 4
cheat boss
waituntil boss_y >= 36 200
waituntil part_t2 >= 44 200
cheat god
cheat posboss -30
waituntil alive0 == 0 30
expect cause == 203
